{"seq":3,"slug":"retransmit-rto","title":"重传、RACK/RTO 与乱序参数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/tcp-http-network-performance/tcp-tuning/retransmit-rto","wordCount":2581,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"重传-rack-rto-与乱序参数\">重传、RACK/RTO 与乱序参数</h1><p>抓包时看到大量重传，第一反应通常是「网络丢包严重」，于是去查链路质量。但在高带宽链路上，重传计数高更常见的原因是<strong>发送端误判</strong>——包只是乱序到达，发送端却以为丢了并重发一份。误判的代价不是多占一点带宽（重传包本身很小），而是 cwnd 被无谓缩减，吞吐掉一个台阶，而这个后果在指标上表现为「应用慢」，与网络质量无关。区分真丢包与误判，以及控制 RTO 与乱序容忍的边界，是本篇的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-rto-的计算与它的两个边界\">核心概念：RTO 的计算与它的两个边界</h2><p>TCP 用超时作为最后的丢失判据。RTO（Retransmission Timeout）必须自适应网络时延，同时不能太短（否则在正常波动时就误判重传，造成「伪重传」风暴）也不能太长（否则真丢包时恢复太慢）。RFC 6298 给出了经典算法：以 RTT 的指数加权移动平均（SRTT）为基准，加上 4 倍的平均偏差（RTTVAR）作为安全边界。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>←</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SRTT \\leftarrow (1-\\alpha)\\,SRTT + \\alpha\\,RTT, \\quad \\alpha = \\frac{1}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>←</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTTVAR \\leftarrow (1-\\beta)\\,RTTVAR + \\beta\\,|SRTT - RTT|, \\quad \\beta = \\frac{1}{4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">RTO = SRTT + \\max(G, 4 \\cdot RTTVAR)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span> 是时钟粒度。RFC 6298 规定 RTO 的下界是 1 秒，这条规定在现代内核上早已不适用——Linux 允许 RTO 低至 200ms，可通过 <code>net.ipv4.tcp_rto_min</code> 调低到毫秒级（数据中心内部常用 10-20ms）。</p>\n<p>Linux 的相关参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>默认</th>\n<th>建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_rto_min</code></td>\n<td>RTO 下界</td>\n<td>200ms（内部毫秒计）</td>\n<td>低延迟内网可降至 20-50ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_rto_max</code></td>\n<td>RTO 上界</td>\n<td>120s</td>\n<td>通常不动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_retries1</code></td>\n<td>疑为故障前的重试次数</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>通常不动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_retries2</code></td>\n<td>放弃连接前的重试次数</td>\n<td>15（约 13-30 分钟）</td>\n<td>长连接场景可评估降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_syn_retries</code></td>\n<td>SYN 重试次数</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>通常不动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意 RTO 有<strong>指数退避</strong>：每次超时后 RTO 翻倍，最多到 <code>tcp_rto_max</code>。所以一个包连续超时几次后，恢复等待会从毫秒级迅速涨到秒级、十几秒。<code>tcp_retries2</code> 默认 15 意味着一条已经完全失联的连接要经历约 15 分钟才会被内核放弃——这个时长对长连接应用是「连接活着但全黑」的窗口，在需要快速故障转移的场景可以评估降低。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[发出数据段] --&gt; B{RTO 内收到 ACK?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[更新 SRTT / RTTVAR&lt;br/&gt;重算 RTO]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D[RTO 超时]&#10;    D --&gt; E[重传最早未确认段&lt;br/&gt;ssthresh = cwnd/2, cwnd = 1]&#10;    E --&gt; F[RTO 指数退避 ×2]&#10;    F --&gt; G{达到 tcp_retries2?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| A&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[放弃连接&lt;br/&gt;报 ETIMEDOUT]&#10;    C --&gt; I{收到重复 ACK?}&#10;    I --&gt;|3 个以上| J[快速重传&lt;br/&gt;不等 RTO]&#10;    I --&gt;|RACK 判定更早| K[RACK 直接重传&lt;br/&gt;不依赖 dup ACK 计数]\">graph TD\n    A[发出数据段] --&gt; B{RTO 内收到 ACK?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[更新 SRTT / RTTVAR&lt;br/&gt;重算 RTO]\n    B --&gt;|否| D[RTO 超时]\n    D --&gt; E[重传最早未确认段&lt;br/&gt;ssthresh = cwnd/2, cwnd = 1]\n    E --&gt; F[RTO 指数退避 ×2]\n    F --&gt; G{达到 tcp_retries2?}\n    G --&gt;|否| A\n    G --&gt;|是| H[放弃连接&lt;br/&gt;报 ETIMEDOUT]\n    C --&gt; I{收到重复 ACK?}\n    I --&gt;|3 个以上| J[快速重传&lt;br/&gt;不等 RTO]\n    I --&gt;|RACK 判定更早| K[RACK 直接重传&lt;br/&gt;不依赖 dup ACK 计数]</pre><h2 id=\"快速重传的边界与-rack-的登场\">快速重传的边界与 RACK 的登场</h2><p>快速重传依赖「3 个重复 ACK」这个计数。这在小窗口时代够用，在现代大窗口下有三个失效场景：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，尾部丢包</strong>。窗口内最后一个（或最后几个）包丢失时，后续没有足够的新数据触发重复 ACK，发送端只能等 RTO。一个 20MB 的窗口里丢掉末尾的包，理论上应该几百微秒内修复，实际要等几十到几百毫秒。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，窗口很小</strong>。如果 cwnd 只有 4-5 个包（弱网或应用发送量小），丢 1 个包后剩下的包可能凑不够 3 个 dup ACK。这是弱网环境下「明明只丢了一个包却卡很久」的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，重排（reordering）</strong>。包在网络里乱序到达时，接收方会发重复 ACK，但那个包其实没丢，稍后就到了。发送端据此重传就是浪费，且会触发无谓的 cwnd 缩减。</p>\n<p>RACK（RFC 8985，Recent ACKNOWLEDGement）改变判据：不再数重复 ACK，而是用<strong>时间</strong>。核心思想是——若我已经确认了序号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的包，而序号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S&#x27; &lt; S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.791em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 的包迟迟未被确认（超过一个 RTT 加一点余量），那么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 很可能真丢了，因为如果它还在网络里，考虑到它比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 发得早，它应该早就到了。判据可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>若 </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mtext>reordering_window 且 </mtext><msup><mi>S</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> 未被确认</mtext><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>判丢</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{若 } t_{now} - t_{sent}(S&#x27;) &gt; RTT + \\text{reordering\\_window} \\text{ 且 } S&#x27; \\text{ 未被确认} \\Rightarrow \\text{判丢}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">若</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1119em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reordering_window</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">且</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">未被确认</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">判丢</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>RACK 需要在包上带发送时间戳（TCP 时间戳选项，<code>net.ipv4.tcp_timestamps=1</code>，默认开启），这也是 RACK 的前提条件。它的优势是三方面的：尾部丢包能在约 1 个 RTT 内检测到（不等 RTO）；不需要凑满 3 个重复 ACK；并且能利用 SACK 信息做更精确的判断。</p>\n<p>Linux 内核从 4.3 起默认启用 RACK（<code>net.ipv4.tcp_recovery</code> 相关的位标志，早期作为 <code>tcp_rack</code> 的替代），并把它与快速重传并存——两者谁先判定为丢失就谁触发重传，因此 RACK 只是<strong>加速</strong>而不是替代经典机制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>尾部丢包检测</th>\n<th>依赖</th>\n<th>误判风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RTO</td>\n<td>计时器超时</td>\n<td>是（但慢）</td>\n<td>RTT 估计</td>\n<td>低（但有伪重传）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>快速重传</td>\n<td>3 个重复 ACK</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>后续包</td>\n<td>中（重排时误判）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SACK</td>\n<td>接收方报告已收块</td>\n<td>是（有 SACK 就能判）</td>\n<td>SACK 选项</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RACK</td>\n<td>已确认包的时间推理</td>\n<td>是，约 1 RTT</td>\n<td>时间戳 + SACK</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DSACK</td>\n<td>接收方报告重复块</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>SACK + DSACK</td>\n<td>用于<strong>撤回</strong>误判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"乱序容忍与-dsack-的反向修正\">乱序容忍与 DSACK 的反向修正</h2><p>网络中的乱序是常态而非异常：多路径转发、链路聚合（LAG）的哈希不均、并行队列调度都会造成乱序。发送端需要容忍合理程度的乱序，否则会把乱序当丢包，触发无谓重传与 cwnd 缩减。</p>\n<p>Linux 用一个内部阈值判断「这次是不是需要因为乱序而调整」，历史上与 <code>net.ipv4.tcp_reordering</code>（默认 3，表示允许的乱序度）相关。现代内核的判断已更多依赖 RACK 的时间推理，<code>tcp_reordering</code> 的作用被弱化，但仍可在乱序严重的链路上观察其影响。</p>\n<p>真正把「误判」反转回来的是 <strong>DSACK</strong>（Duplicate SACK，RFC 2883）。接收方收到重复数据块时，用 SACK 选项的最小块报告「我收到了重复的这个块」。发送端收到 DSACK 后可以做两件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>撤回 cwnd 缩减</strong>。若删掉的重传是 DSACK 证实的多余重传，说明网络只是乱序，发送端可以把 cwnd 恢复到误判前的水平（Linux 实现了 <code>undo</code> 机制：<code>tp-&gt;undo_marker</code>、<code>tp-&gt;undo_retrans</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>调整乱序估计</strong>。连续的 DSACK 会告诉内核这条路径的乱序程度比预想的大，内核据此提高容忍度，减少后续误判。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这是全篇最重要的实践含义：<strong>看到重传计数高，先看有多少是 DSACK 证实的伪重传</strong>。<code>nstat</code> 里的 <code>TcpExtTCPDSACKRecv</code>、<code>TcpExtTCPDSACKOfoRecv</code> 分别统计收到的 DSACK 与乱序 DSACK。若 <code>TcpDSACKRecv</code> 与 <code>TCPRetransSegs</code> 比例很高，说明问题在乱序（路径问题）而不是丢包（拥塞问题），此时该查的是链路聚合的哈希策略或中间设备的转发顺序，而不是去调拥塞控制。</p>\n<p>相关参数与计数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数/计数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>观察用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_sack</code></td>\n<td>启用 SACK</td>\n<td>默认 1；仅在已知 bug 路径上才关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_dsack</code></td>\n<td>启用 DSACK</td>\n<td>默认 1；是撤回误判的基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_timestamps</code></td>\n<td>启用时间戳</td>\n<td>RACK 的前提；关掉会失去 RACK</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>net.ipv4.tcp_early_retrans</code></td>\n<td>早期重传（含 RACK/TLP）</td>\n<td>默认 3；不建议关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TcpExtTCPDSACKRecv</code></td>\n<td>收到的 DSACK 数</td>\n<td>高 = 之前有伪重传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TcpExtTCPDSACKOfoRecv</code></td>\n<td>乱序触发的 DSACK</td>\n<td>高 = 路径乱序严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TcpExtTCPLostRetransmit</code></td>\n<td>重传包本身又丢了</td>\n<td>高 = 链路持续拥塞或 RTO 过短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TcpExtTCPTimeouts</code></td>\n<td>RTO 超时次数</td>\n<td>高 = 严重拥塞或对端异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TcpExtTCPFastRetrans</code></td>\n<td>快速重传次数</td>\n<td>与 Timeouts 对比看恢复路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>另一个值得注意的机制是 <strong>TLP</strong>（Tail Loss Probe，RFC 8985 的配套）。它在「发送端已发的所有数据都被确认，但窗口已满、应用还有数据要发」的情况下，若超过 2 个 RTT 没有新 ACK，则主动发送一个新数据段（而非重传）来触发对端的 ACK，从而产生 SACK 信息让 RACK 能判定丢失。TLP 解决的是「应用层没有新数据可发，无法触发重复 ACK」这个死角，是 RACK 体系里不可缺少的一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产诊断流程\">生产诊断流程</h2><p>面对「重传多、吞吐低」的报告，按下面的顺序走，能在几分钟内分清是路径问题还是拥塞问题。</p>\n<p>第一步，取全局计数并算出关键比值。<code>nstat -az TcpRetransSegs TcpOutSegs TcpExtTCPTimeouts TcpExtTCPFastRetrans TcpExtTCPDSACKRecv</code>。<code>TcpRetransSegs / TcpOutSegs</code> 是重传率，健康值在万分之几到千分之一量级；超过 1% 需要解释。<code>TCPTimeouts</code> 若与 <code>TCPFastRetrans</code> 同量级，说明超时路径在大量参与，正常情况应是 <code>TCPTimeouts</code> 远小于 <code>TCPFastRetrans</code>。</p>\n<p>第二步，看伪重传占比。<code>TCPDSACKRecv / TcpRetransSegs</code> 高（比如超过 30%）说明相当一部分重传是误判，问题偏向路径乱序。反之则是真实丢包。</p>\n<p>第三步，落到单条连接。<code>ss -tin</code> 里的 <code>retrans</code>（该连接的重传数）、<code>rtt</code>/<code>rttvar</code>（是否剧烈波动）、<code>cwnd</code> 与 <code>ssthresh</code>（是否长期处于恢复后的低位）、以及 <code>lastsnd</code>/<code>lastack</code>（是否长时间没有 ACK）。若某条连接的 <code>retrans</code> 远超其他连接，问题往往在它自身的路径或它访问的对端，而不是本机。</p>\n<p>第四步，抓包确认。抓包方法见 <a href=\"../nic-diagnostics/tcpdump-wireshark\">tcpdump/Wireshark 抓包与重传分析</a>，要点是看「重传包与原始包的时间差」——若时间差约为 RTO（且呈指数退避的模式），是 RTO 路径；若约为 1 个 RTT 或更短，是快速重传/RACK 路径。同时检查是否真的丢了（原始包在接收侧从未出现）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RTO 由 SRTT + 4×RTTVAR 计算并指数退避；下界在 Linux 可调（<code>tcp_rto_min</code>），上界与重试次数（<code>tcp_retries2</code> 默认 15，约 15 分钟）决定了失联连接的存活窗口。</li>\n<li>快速重传依赖 3 个重复 ACK，在尾部丢包、小窗口、严重重排三种场景下失效；RACK 用时间戳推理替代计数，能在约 1 个 RTT 内检测尾部丢包。</li>\n<li>RACK 需要时间戳选项，与快速重传并存（谁先判定谁触发），不是替代品；TLP 补上了「应用无新数据可发」的死角。</li>\n<li>DSACK 是唯一的反向修正机制：它让发送端撤回因误判造成的 cwnd 缩减，并提高对路径乱序的容忍估计。</li>\n<li>诊断的第一步是算两个比值——重传率与 DSACK 占比——前者判断严重程度，后者区分乱序与真实丢包，这决定了后面该查路径还是查拥塞。</li>\n<li>关掉 <code>tcp_sack</code>、<code>tcp_dsack</code>、<code>tcp_timestamps</code> 中任何一个都会削弱这套判定体系，除非有明确的中间盒兼容问题，否则保持默认。</li>\n<li>重传只是丢包的后果之一，丢包对窗口演化的影响见 <a href=\"../congestion-control/cwnd-reno-cubic\">拥塞窗口、Reno/CUBIC 与丢包反馈</a>；不看丢包的算法见 <a href=\"../congestion-control/bbr-bottleneck-bw\">BBR：瓶颈带宽与 RTT 模型及部署</a>。</li>\n<li>缓冲区过小也会表现为重传（因为丢包发生在接收侧），这类问题见 <a href=\"kernel-parameters\">核心 sysctl 参数与读写缓冲区自整定</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重传、RACK/RTO 与乱序参数","id":"重传-rack-rto-与乱序参数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：RTO 的计算与它的两个边界","id":"核心概念-rto-的计算与它的两个边界"},{"level":2,"text":"快速重传的边界与 RACK 的登场","id":"快速重传的边界与-rack-的登场"},{"level":2,"text":"乱序容忍与 DSACK 的反向修正","id":"乱序容忍与-dsack-的反向修正"},{"level":2,"text":"生产诊断流程","id":"生产诊断流程"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"核心 sysctl 参数与读写缓冲区自整定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/tcp-http-network-performance/tcp-tuning/kernel-parameters"},"next":{"title":"TLS 1.3 握手、0-RTT 与重放边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/tcp-http-network-performance/tls-performance/tls13-handshake"}}